        "statement": "Assume the Axiom of Choice. For every nonempty closed connected oriented smooth $3$-manifold $M$, there is a finite oriented link $L=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}K_i\\subset S^3$ and an integer $n_i$ for each component such that the oriented manifold obtained by simultaneous surgery with meridian slopes $n_i[\\mu_i]+[\\lambda_i]$ is orientation-preservingly diffeomorphic to $M$. The empty link is allowed and presents $S^3$."
